<title>FRANCE: Moulinex requotes at 144.90 francs.</title>
<headline>Moulinex requotes at 144.90 francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Moulinex requoted at 144 francs after being suspended limit up ealier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The share rose from its initial requote level, trading up to 144.90 francs before retreating.</p>
<p>The share rose on Tuesday after the company predicted improvement in its operating results despite a drop in activity.</p>
<p>Its new upper and lower limits were set at 151.70 francs and 137.30 francs, respectively.</p>
<p>It was suspended at 144.50 francs per share.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
